This project models, simulates and analyses a solenoid in ANSYS Maxwell 3D using 
magnetostatic analysis. The work covers geometry creation (Polygon Helix coil), 
environment/region definition, conduction path extraction, material assignment, excitation 
application, meshing strategy, and verification against analytical relations. The report 
documents the full workflow, provides analytic checks (with worked calculations), suggests 
parametric studies and next steps (optimization, transient/eddy current analysis, hardware 
validation).

